msgid ""
"A *controller* machine to run the installation scripts. Typical "
"desktop/laptop hardware is plenty. See below for software requirements."
msgstr ""
"Een machine om de installatie scripts te controleren. Typische "
"desktop/laptop hardware is genoeg. Zie beneden voor software vereiste."

msgid "Software Requirements"
msgstr "Software Requirement"

msgid ""
"A supported Linux operating system should be installed on the *target* "
"machine:"
msgstr ""
"Een gesteund Linux-operatiesysteem moet geïnstalleerd worden op de traject "
"machine:"

msgid "Ubuntu 18.04"
msgstr "Ubuntu 18.04"

msgid "Ubuntu 20.04"
msgstr "Ubuntu 20.04"

msgid "CentOS/RHEL 7"
msgstr "CentOS 7"

